    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column is-two-thirds-tablet">
        <p style="margin-bottom: .5em">Query: <a href="/search/advanced?classification-computer_science=y&amp;classification-include_cross_list=include&amp;date-filter_by=date_range&amp;abstracts=show&amp;size=50&amp;start=0&amp;terms-0-operator=AND&amp;terms-0-term=GPU&amp;terms-0-field=all&amp;terms-1-operator=OR&amp;terms-1-term=decoding&amp;terms-1-field=all&amp;terms-2-operator=OR&amp;terms-2-term=kernel&amp;terms-2-field=all&amp;terms-3-operator=OR&amp;terms-3-term=%22inference+serving%22&amp;terms-3-field=all&amp;date-from_date=2025-11-01&amp;date-to_date=2025-12-01&amp;date-date_type=announced_date_first&amp;order=-announced_date_first">order: -announced_date_first; size: 50; date_range: from 2025-11-01 to 2025-12-01; classification: Computer Science (cs); include_cross_list: True; terms: AND all=GPU; OR all=decoding; OR all=kernel; OR all=&#34;inference serving&#34;</a></p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="button is-link" href="/search/advanced?classification-computer_science=y&amp;classification-include_cross_list=include&amp;date-filter_by=date_range&amp;abstracts=show&amp;size=50&amp;start=0&amp;terms-0-operator=AND&amp;terms-0-term=GPU&amp;terms-0-field=all&amp;terms-1-operator=OR&amp;terms-1-term=decoding&amp;terms-1-field=all&amp;terms-2-operator=OR&amp;terms-2-term=kernel&amp;terms-2-field=all&amp;terms-3-operator=OR&amp;terms-3-term=%22inference+serving%22&amp;terms-3-field=all&amp;date-from_date=2025-11-01&amp;date-to_date=2025-12-01&amp;date-date_type=announced_date_first&amp;order=-announced_date_first">Refine query</a><a class="button" href="/search/advanced">New search</a>
        </div>
